[{"id":744224,"tag_name":"v2.0.6","target_commitish":"148bb9f97f64ab7515c1a59e2da12715fab36890","prerelease":false,"name":"v2.0.6","body":"## 修复\n- 恢复 Electron 43 下原生拖拽导入快捷方式\n- 按快捷方式最终启动目标去重，一键导入与拖入均不会重复添加同一程序\n- 重复项目显示明确的跳过提示，不再显示拖入遮罩\n- 修复异步状态覆盖导致的应用数据回退问题\n- 优化窗口边界、工具栏与无障碍交互\n\n## 验证\n- TypeScript 类型检查通过\n- 18 项自动化测试全部通过\n- npm audit：0 个漏洞\n\n\u003E Windows 安装包暂未进行代码签名，首次运行时系统可能显示安全提示。","author":{"id":17318715,"login":"wanwuan","name":"Wan-Wuan","avatar_url":"https://gitee.com/assets/no_portrait.png","url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan","html_url":"https://gitee.com/wanwuan","remark":"","followers_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/followers","following_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/following_url{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/orgs","repos_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/repos","events_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/received_events","type":"User"},"created_at":"2026-07-13T15:35:21+08:00","assets":[{"browser_download_url":"https://gitee.com/wanwuan/tidy_desktop/releases/download/v2.0.6/tidy-desktop-Setup-2.0.6.exe.sha256","name":"tidy-desktop-Setup-2.0.6.exe.sha256"},{"browser_download_url":"https://gitee.com/wanwuan/tidy_desktop/releases/download/v2.0.6/tidy-desktop-Setup-2.0.6.exe.blockmap","name":"tidy-desktop-Setup-2.0.6.exe.blockmap"},{"browser_download_url":"https://gitee.com/wanwuan/tidy_desktop/archive/refs/tags/v2.0.6.zip","name":"v2.0.6.zip"},{"browser_download_url":"https://gitee.com/wanwuan/tidy_desktop/archive/refs/tags/v2.0.6.tar.gz","name":"v2.0.6.tar.gz"}]},{"id":745912,"tag_name":"v2.0.7","target_commitish":"b1ec4726f2284e6ee0f34c8259a3714be28026be","prerelease":false,"name":"v2.0.7","body":"## 新功能\n\n- 删除分类或子分类时可选择保留应用或一并移除\n- 保留的应用会移入“全部”，同时清除分类和子分类归属\n- 删除分类时会正确处理其所有子分类中的应用\n- 删除操作支持撤销\n\n## 修复与优化\n\n- 修复删除数据持久化失败时界面与磁盘状态不一致的问题，失败会自动回滚\n- 优化删除确认弹窗、受影响数量提示和深色模式显示\n\n## 验证\n\n- TypeScript 类型检查通过\n- 22 项自动化测试全部通过\n- npm audit：0 个漏洞\n\n\u003E Windows 安装包暂未进行代码签名，首次运行时系统可能显示安全提示。\n","author":{"id":17318715,"login":"wanwuan","name":"Wan-Wuan","avatar_url":"https://gitee.com/assets/no_portrait.png","url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan","html_url":"https://gitee.com/wanwuan","remark":"","followers_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/followers","following_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/following_url{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/orgs","repos_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/repos","events_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/received_events","type":"User"},"created_at":"2026-07-14T18:04:06+08:00","assets":[{"browser_download_url":"https://gitee.com/wanwuan/tidy_desktop/releases/download/v2.0.7/tidy-desktop-Setup-2.0.7.exe.sha256","name":"tidy-desktop-Setup-2.0.7.exe.sha256"},{"browser_download_url":"https://gitee.com/wanwuan/tidy_desktop/releases/download/v2.0.7/tidy-desktop-Setup-2.0.7.exe.blockmap","name":"tidy-desktop-Setup-2.0.7.exe.blockmap"},{"browser_download_url":"https://gitee.com/wanwuan/tidy_desktop/archive/refs/tags/v2.0.7.zip","name":"v2.0.7.zip"},{"browser_download_url":"https://gitee.com/wanwuan/tidy_desktop/archive/refs/tags/v2.0.7.tar.gz","name":"v2.0.7.tar.gz"}]},{"id":1127955,"tag_name":"v2.2.0","target_commitish":"17cd488938552dd9803738de93677e27866277b8","prerelease":false,"name":"v2.2.0","body":"## 新功能\n\n### 操作效率\n- **应用卡片右键菜单**：打开、以管理员运行、打开所在位置、复制路径、移动到分类（含子分类/未分类）、在搜索中隐藏、编辑、删除\n- **主窗口键盘导航**：方向键在网格间移动焦点，Enter/空格打开，F2 编辑\n- **批量多选**：Ctrl 点选、Shift 范围选择，底部操作条支持批量移动分类/隐藏/删除（带撤销快照）\n- **排序方式**：手动（可拖拽）/ 按名称 / 按常用 / 按最近使用\n\n### 个性化\n- **主题色自定义**：6 个预设色板 + 自定义拾色器，浅色/深色主题即时生效\n- **搜索框设置**：宽度、垂直位置、结果条数可调，支持一键恢复默认\n- **失焦自动隐藏**（可选）：点击其它窗口时自动收起搜索框\n- 深色主题全面重构，覆盖更完整\n\n### 数据安全\n- **自动滚动备份**：每天首次启动自动备份配置、项目与分类，每类保留最近 7 份，可在设置中打开备份目录\n- 数据文件损坏时自动留档（.corrupt 文件），不再静默丢失\n\n### 行为与细节\n- **关闭按钮行为可设置**：最小化到托盘（默认）或退出程序；首次驻留托盘时有系统通知提醒\n- **启动时最小化到托盘**（可选）、窗口位置记忆、托盘单击即可打开主窗口\n- **自动分类规则编辑器**：在整理中心可视化维护“关键词 → 分类”规则\n- **快捷命令开关**：搜索框中的关机/重启等系统命令可按需关闭\n- 快捷键支持一键恢复默认；手动添加应用/文件夹时按路径去重\n\n### 修复\n- 深浅色主题的对比度与可读性问题\n- Esc 在分类菜单/对话框打开时误隐藏整个窗口\n- 启动失败的应用不再计入“智能启动”与搜索排序权重\n- Steam 路径改为读注册表，非默认安装位置也能取到本地图标\n- 图标缓存键冲突（超长路径）与旧缓存自动清理","author":{"id":17318715,"login":"wanwuan","name":"Wan-Wuan","avatar_url":"https://gitee.com/assets/no_portrait.png","url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan","html_url":"https://gitee.com/wanwuan","remark":"","followers_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/followers","following_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/following_url{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/orgs","repos_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/repos","events_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/received_events","type":"User"},"created_at":"2026-09-06T22:34:49+08:00","assets":[{"browser_download_url":"https://gitee.com/wanwuan/tidy_desktop/releases/download/v2.2.0/tidy-desktop-Setup-2.2.0.exe","name":"tidy-desktop-Setup-2.2.0.exe"},{"browser_download_url":"https://gitee.com/wanwuan/tidy_desktop/releases/download/v2.2.0/tidy-desktop-Setup-2.2.0.exe.sha256","name":"tidy-desktop-Setup-2.2.0.exe.sha256"},{"browser_download_url":"https://gitee.com/wanwuan/tidy_desktop/archive/refs/tags/v2.2.0.zip","name":"v2.2.0.zip"},{"browser_download_url":"https://gitee.com/wanwuan/tidy_desktop/archive/refs/tags/v2.2.0.tar.gz","name":"v2.2.0.tar.gz"}]},{"id":1128011,"tag_name":"v2.1.1","target_commitish":"1e75a6c9f579e2bb79ff9fa6662e7af67dbc42e7","prerelease":false,"name":"Tidy Desktop v2.1.1","body":"## 新增\r\n\r\n- 应用右键菜单：以管理员身份打开、复制路径、移动到分类/子分类、隐藏应用\r\n- 右键拖拽排序与归类；图片/文档走系统原生拖拽，可直接发送到外部应用\r\n- 键盘导航：方向键按网格移动卡片焦点，Enter/Space 打开，F2 编辑\r\n- 设置新增「点击关闭按钮时」选项：最小化到托盘 / 退出程序\r\n- 记住上次浏览的分类，下次启动自动恢复\r\n\r\n## 改进\r\n\r\n- 配置文件解析失败时自动留档（`.corrupt-*`），不再静默丢弃数据\r\n- 启动时自动备份数据\r\n- 首次最小化到托盘时给出系统通知\r\n- 设置 AppUserModelId，修复 Windows 通知归属与任务栏分组\r\n- 安装包体积从 260MB 降到 102MB\r\n\r\n## 安装\r\n\r\n下载 `tidy-desktop-Setup-2.1.1.exe` 运行即可，已安装的旧版本会就地升级。\r\n\r\nSHA256：`b793addfbe17d97b9436c365ea1ddf06e95b13d46b0f082f93c7f50e42462078`\r\n","author":{"id":17318715,"login":"wanwuan","name":"Wan-Wuan","avatar_url":"https://gitee.com/assets/no_portrait.png","url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan","html_url":"https://gitee.com/wanwuan","remark":"","followers_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/followers","following_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/following_url{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/orgs","repos_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/repos","events_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://gitee.com/api/v5/users/wanwuan/received_events","type":"User"},"created_at":"2026-09-06T23:08:24+08:00","assets":[{"browser_download_url":"https://gitee.com/wanwuan/tidy_desktop/archive/refs/tags/v2.1.